{% comment %}
  Anchor page icons
  Path data is transcribed verbatim from the Figma exports for
  "128 Audit Fixes" / Anchor page (node 9172:31), so geometry matches the design.
  Fills use currentColor — colour is set in assets/anchor-page.css.

  Parameters:
    - icon (Required - String): arrow | heart | play | star
    - classes (Optional - String)

  Note: the arrow is a single glyph in the design. It appears at 12.25x10.5
  (VIEW ALL / SHOP NOW) and at 10.5x9 (READ MORE) — the same viewBox scaled,
  so one definition covers every use. Sizing is handled by CSS.
{% endcomment %}

